{"id":"n16333-3-8","stage":2,"title":"난리 · 战乱","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16333-3-8-1","ko":"엄마, 할아버지 고향은 어디예요?","zh":"妈妈，爷爷的家乡是哪里呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"할아버지","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}},{"text":"고향은","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향은","audio":"/audio/7101c0fa2bb8449711e9.mp3"}},{"text":"어디예요?","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디예요","audio":"/audio/bfd200547b59b5d6cf56.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a",